# Keep LF line endings in every checkout, Windows included. Prettier (format:check) expects LF,
# and core.autocrlf would otherwise turn files into CRLF on checkout and fail the check locally.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch their bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
